00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:52.320
It's the message of the Fantasia

00:22:52.320 --> 00:22:56.820
You're the one who gave 
me the courage to weave

00:22:56.820 --> 00:23:02.060
So I always want you by my side

00:23:12.720 --> 00:23:17.040
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:12.720 --> 00:23:17.040
