00:23:42.720 --> 00:23:44.750
Spend however much you need.

00:23:44.750 --> 00:23:48.590
Just find them in time for our 
fifth anniversary concert.

00:23:48.590 --> 00:23:49.570
Yuki.

00:23:54.790 --> 00:23:59.180
